title: Unitary Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: unity_fundraising_timer <= 0
on-arrival: unity_fundraising_timer = 12; month_actions += 1
is-card: true
card-image: img/jxsi/centmil.jpg
face-image: img/jxsi/centmil.jpg
tags: jxsi_party
role: card-party

= Fundraising

Fact is, even as a part of a coalition as big as jxsi, we still needs resources to work. [? if party_income < 2: Right now, the vast majority of our funding comes from public subsidies, which are dependant on our electoral results. ?][? if party_income > 2: Despite a part of our funding still coming from public subsidies, our recent party affiliation rates hike means we are less dependant on those than what we used to be. ?] While we can tweak internal [+ player_party +] membership dues, changing public party subsidies is out of the table for as long as we're a part of the jxsi coalition.

# TODO: jxcat equivalent where the union is more formalized and allows for actual increase in rates

- @raise_rates_erc
- @lower_rates_erc
- @donations_campaign
- @donations_lowkey
- @root: We do not need to discuss funding at this moment
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@raise_rates_erc
title: Raise party dues
choose-if: party_income < 2
unavailable-subtitle: Party dues are already as high as they can reasonably be.
view-if: player_party = "erc"
go-to: erc_fundraising.raise_rates

@lower_rates_erc
title: Lower party dues
view-if: player_party = "erc"
subtitle: [? if party_income = 2: \[-1 resources\]?]
choose-if: party_income >= 1 and (party_resources > 0 or party_income < 2)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if party_income < 1: Dues are already as low as they can be. ?][? if party_resources < 1 and party_income == 2: Not enough resources. ?]
go-to: erc_fundraising.raise_rates

@donations_campaign
title: Let's carry out a donations campaign!
subtitle: \[ +3 resources\]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.party_resources += 3;
    Q.independence_movement -= 12;
    Q.independence_trust -= 5;

    var targetCongreso = Q.player_party;
    var targetLocal = Q.player_party;
    if (Q.erc_in_jxsi) {
        if (Q.jxsi_in_congreso) {
            targetCongreso = "jxsi";
        }
        if (Q.jxsi_in_local) {
            targetLocal = "jxsi";
        }
    }

    for (var c of Q.parlament_constituencies) {
        var delta_jxsi_young_support = Q["jxsi_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] * 0.1;
        var delta_jxsi_ind_support = Q["jxsi_parlament_" + c + "_ind_support"] * 0.1;
        var delta_jxsi_middle_support = Q["jxsi_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] * 0.05;
        var delta_jxsi_unemployed_support = Q["jxsi_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] * 0.1;

        if (Q.psc_recovery_factor <= 1){
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.5 * delta_jxsi_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.4 * delta_jxsi_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.1 * delta_jxsi_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.2 * delta_jxsi_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.1 * delta_jxsi_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.5 * delta_jxsi_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.2 * delta_jxsi_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.2 * delta_jxsi_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.4 * delta_jxsi_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.2 * delta_jxsi_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.2 * delta_jxsi_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.3 * delta_jxsi_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.3 * delta_jxsi_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.1 * delta_jxsi_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.3 * delta_jxsi_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
        } else {
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.5 * delta_jxsi_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.3 * delta_jxsi_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.2 * delta_jxsi_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.2 * delta_jxsi_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.1 * delta_jxsi_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.2 * delta_jxsi_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.5 * delta_jxsi_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.2 * delta_jxsi_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.3 * delta_jxsi_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.4 * delta_jxsi_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.1 * delta_jxsi_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.3 * delta_jxsi_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.2 * delta_jxsi_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.4 * delta_jxsi_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "jxsi", amount: 0.1 * delta_jxsi_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
        }        
    }
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "congreso", to: "abstain", from:  targetCongreso, amount: 0.3, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: ["catalunya"] });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "congreso", to: "federal_left", from:  targetCongreso, amount: 0.15, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: ["catalunya"] });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "congreso", to: "psoe", from:  targetCongreso, amount: 0.15, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: ["catalunya"] });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "barcelona", to: "bcomu", from:  targetLocal, amount: 0.2, maxDonorFraction: 0.5 });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "barcelona", to: "psc", from:  targetLocal, amount: 0.1, maxDonorFraction: 0.5 });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "barcelona", to: "cup", from:  targetLocal, amount: 0.1, maxDonorFraction: 0.5 });
!}

While the donations campaign has been a huge success, some are not very happy about the feeling it has left lingering on some potential voters. We may have alienated some here...

@donations_lowkey
title: Let's request donations, but let's keep it low-key, and do so via civil organizations close to the parties in jxsi
subtitle: \[ +1 resources\]
on-arrival: party_resources += 1; independence_movement -= 5; erc_civic_dissent += 8; erc_left_dissent += 3;

A focused, scope-limited donations campaign, mostly through the ANC and Òmnium Cultural, has brought some liquidity. The organizations are not super thrilled about playing this role, but for now we can congratulate ourselves on a successful campaign.
